; Regression: .const symbols (and LABEL+OFFSET expressions) must be accepted
; as LI immediates. The validator used to reject 'label' for imm16 even though
; getImm16Operand already resolved them, so the documented
; "LI R0, SERVICE_*" style failed to assemble.
.const BASE 0x1000
LI R0, BASE
LI R1, BASE+4
HALT
